  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "LLRP: Add support for ImpinjRFDopplerFrequency parameter",
  "description": "Support for this parameter is expected, because ImpinjEnableRFDopplerFrequency is already supported. The changes are very simple - same principle as with ImpinjEnableRFPhaseAngle and ImpinjRFPhaseAngle parameters which were already supported in the first place.\n\nThe changes only encompass 1 file: epan/dissectors/packet-llrp.c\n\nWithout those changes, Impinj UHF RFID readers that are configured to use Impinj-specific extensions and to report the Doppler frequency parameter, will have their PDUs marked as malformed by Wireshark. \n\nSee GUI before & after changes.\nBefore:\n![image](/uploads/33fe33df2c173ae0aeebac7092473e53/image.png){width=900 height=248}\nAfter:\n![image](/uploads/ce65f7904289db9529558e98007b1531/image.png){width=900 height=197}",
